{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Nexistoreum</i> is an educational exploration game that immerses players in the world of ancient artifacts from Southern Thailand \u2014 from locally styled Buddha statues and old coins to earthenware pots and tools that reflect the way of life in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You take on the role of an explorer visiting an interactive museum, where every object holds a story and hidden history waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Design:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive exploration:</strong> Stroll through a 3D museum intricately crafted to showcase ancient relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engaging learning:</strong> Click on objects to reveal historical facts, accompanied by voice narration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Southern Thai ambiance:</strong> Backgrounds, music, and artistic elements are inspired by authentic Southern Thai culture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Localization:</strong> Thai</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630120?t=1743666098","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630120?t=1743666098","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630120/b78465d94d2ff04bde760d3bf57fc8f62bf9616b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743666098","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630120/b78465d94d2ff04bde760d3bf57fc8f62bf9616b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743666098","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong></p><p class=\"b